Subject: [PATCH] presentation: use compact navigation and reveal it on reverse
 scrolling

Shared navigation policy with Mihon 0047. Use native Material3 ShortNavigationBar, preserve labels preference, tablet rails, multi-select and casting. Opt browsing toolbars into enterAlways, keeping category tabs and safety insets. The observer never consumes drag distance or fling velocity.
